  "question": {
    "text": "if the coefficients of three consecutive terms in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;are the ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>then the coefficient of the fourth term is&nbsp;"
